{"id":47512,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=47512"},"modified":"2026-10-02T09:41:30","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T08:41:30","slug":"meia-maratona-da-nazare","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-da-nazare\/","title":{"rendered":"50\u00aa Meia Maratona Internacional da Nazar\u00e9 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">50\u00aa Meia Maratona Internacional da Nazar\u00e9 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>50\u00aa Meia Maratona Internacional da Nazar\u00e9 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>15 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com partida agendada para as <strong>10:00<\/strong> na <strong>Avenida da Rep\u00fablica<\/strong>, no concelho da <strong>Nazar\u00e9<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>. Esta emblem\u00e1tica competi\u00e7\u00e3o atl\u00e9tica celebra a sua 50\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o hist\u00f3rica, afirmando-se como a meia-maratona mais antiga de Portugal num cen\u00e1rio de enorme beleza \u00e0 beira-mar.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partida na <strong>Avenida da Rep\u00fablica<\/strong> (no entroncamento com a Avenida Vieira Guimar\u00e3es) e meta instalada na <strong>Pra\u00e7a Sousa Oliveira<\/strong>, o tra\u00e7ado de <strong>21,0975 km<\/strong> \u00e9 quase integralmente plano, estendendo-se pela marginal, Porto de Pesca e EN 242 at\u00e9 ao retorno em Famalic\u00e3o. O evento integra em simult\u00e2neo a <strong>Volta \u00e0 Nazar\u00e9 (10 km)<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada (8 km)<\/strong>, atraindo corredores de elite e pelot\u00f5es populares.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o do evento est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>Meia Maratona Internacional da Nazar\u00e9 &#8211; Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Cultura e Desporto<\/strong>, com apoio do Munic\u00edpio da Nazar\u00e9 e cronometragem oficial da Recorde Pessoal.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"colo